  "description": "MAVMII crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C118 H162 La6 N28 O14. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 3 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 3 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 3 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 3 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.033-4.061 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.43-114.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C118H162La6N28O14.",
